OL,6,     FThe man behind, Anthropic, the
OL,7,     Fartificial intelligence (AI)
OL,8,     Fcompany behind Claude, is taking
OL,9,     Fthe company public this month, it
OL,10,     Fcould be the world's biggest
OL,11,     Finitial public offering.
