OL,13,     FAdam Rutherford and Jessica
OL,14,     FFostekew explore nature's
OL,15,     Fsurprisingly valuable deposits.
OL,16,G2000 Stevie's Inner Visions
OL,17,     FIn 1973, Stevie Wonder released
OL,18,     Fthe iconic album Innervisions, a
OL,19,     Fmasterpiece of social commentary
OL,20,     Fand symphonic artistry. This is
OL,21,     Fthe story of how, days later, he
OL,22,     Falmost died.
